      "end_timestamp": "00:54",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Around three days... no wait, it's more like two days.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:55",
      "end_timestamp": "01:00",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Alright, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:02",
      "end_timestamp": "01:11",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, mornings. That makes it worse. It's mild, honestly. I'd say on and off.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:13",
      "end_timestamp": "01:20",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Does anything else come with it?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:22",
      "end_timestamp": "01:24",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Let me think, it usually comes with tiredness.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:31",
      "end_timestamp": "01:35",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "The tiredness? That's been for about a month.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:59",
      "end_timestamp": "02:03",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
